  "details": "Adding a better key mapper would be a good thing.. And when i say Full. i mean fully every button that is usable in vrchat. Not only desktop mode but even remapping the vive controllers if you use an vive Emulator that is TrinusVR And Touchmote for wiimotes in order to make them work as gamepads. it would be a great option to remap all of the buttons as you wish.. But its one example it would be also useful if you want to make some changes in the hand gestures or other parts of the controller. \n\nBetter options. Having a better bigger and wider variety of options in like an advanced tab would be nice. and expecting it to have all the other useful things that the normal option don't have like the graphics settings keyboard custom layout ect.",
